  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil and butter in a pan and add the cumin seeds.",
    "Add the onion and cook until golden brown, then add the ginger garlic paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato puree, turmeric, chilli powder, coriander powder and salt and cook for 8-10 minutes until the oil separates.",
    "Add the green peas and the water, cover and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the paneer cubes and gently mix, then simmer for 4-5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the cream and garam masala, cook for 1 minute and garnish with coriander leaves."
  ]
